# What `eas build` leaves out of the upload. EAS reads this file from the
# repository root, and when it exists it is used INSTEAD of every .gitignore
# in the tree — so the rules below are the .gitignore files' own (root,
# native/, notesd/), with one deliberate difference:
#
#   native/web/ is NOT ignored here. It is the embedded web app, built by
#   `make build-native` (in CI, by .github/workflows/native-build.yml, which
#   bakes the Dropbox key into it) and copied into the binary at prebuild by
#   native/plugins/with-web-bundle.js. It is gitignored because it is build
#   output; left out of the upload, prebuild on the EAS worker fails.
#
# Keep this in step with the .gitignore files when they change.

# Common
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tmp
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Coverage
.coverage/
coverage/

# Generated docs
docs/_build/

# Node / Vite
node_modules/
dist/
dev-dist/
.vite/
web-build/

# Service worker output
public/sw.js
public/workbox-*.js

# React Native / Expo — generated by `expo prebuild`, which runs on the EAS
# worker. Anchored: a bare `ios/` would also drop modules/*/ios, the native
# modules' own sources.
.expo/
native/android/
native/ios/
native/.metro-health-check*
native/package-lock.json

# Transient release artifacts
.release-notes.md

# Store submission output and the listing's words (see .gitignore)
native/store/copy.mts
native/store/store.config.json
native/store/screenshots/
native/fastlane/metadata/

# Credentials — never uploaded
play-service-account.json
*.p8
*.p12
*.keystore

# The desktop shell's and the daemon's build output
tauri/target/
tauri/webroot/*
!tauri/webroot/.gitkeep
tauri/src-tauri/gen/
notesd/target/
